# Product Overview

This is a SaaS platform for document management and approval workflows.

The system allows companies to manage projects, upload documents, and run structured approval processes across multiple participants.

---

# User Types

## 1. End Users (SaaS Users)

These are companies and their members.

They can:
- Create and manage projects
- Upload and manage documents
- Participate in approval workflows
- Receive and interact with notifications

---

## 2. Super Admin (Platform Owner)

This is the platform-level administrator.

They can:
- Manage all users and companies
- Configure system-wide limits
- Configure notification behavior
- Manage storage integrations (e.g. AWS S3)
- Manage email systems (e.g. Resend)
- Access metrics and system insights

---

# Core Features

- Projects
- Documents
- Document Versions
- Approval Workflows
- Notifications system
- Multi-tenant company separation

---

# Product Principles

- The system must feel simple despite complex workflows
- UX must prioritize clarity over density
- Actions must be obvious and guided
- The system should reduce friction in approval processes

---

# Multi-Tenancy

- Each company operates independently
- Data must be logically isolated per company
- Users belong to companies